{
  "name": "Google - Credential Health Check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Google - Credential Health Check\n\nChecks the Gmail OAuth2 credential twice daily at 06:00 and 18:00.\n\nScope:\n- Tests the existing Gmail credential with a harmless read-only Gmail request.\n- Sends a Mattermost alert only when the Gmail request fails, which usually means the Google OAuth credential needs reconnecting.\n\nPrerequisites:\n- Gmail OAuth2 credential: `Gmail account`\n- Sub-workflow: `Mattermost - Send Message`\n- Mattermost default channel configured in `Mattermost - Send Message`",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 672
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        400
      ],
      "id": "cfb14d69-3b28-469a-b5d1-2a3957b35027",
      "name": "Workflow note"
    },
